.TH GPU-STACK-INFO 1 "" "gpu_driver_stack" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gpu-stack-info \- list the GPU driver plugins this system can load
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpu-stack-info
[\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-require\-plugin\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gpu-stack-info
loads every driver plugin it can find through the gpu_core plugin loader,
negotiates the plugin ABI version, and prints each device it creates. When
no plugin loads, it falls back to the built-in software rasterizer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version, source commit, compiler and build type, then exit.
.TP
.B \-\-require\-plugin
Exit with status 1 if no plugin loads, instead of using the fallback.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GPU_STACK_DRIVERS
Colon-separated list of plugin files to load instead of the default
plugin installed next to this program.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on failure, 2 on a usage error.
